        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_5": "<p>Is my order discreet?</p>",
        "gg4a8x2zCkC_text": "<p>Wellness Nest uses the Ayurvedic Absorption Pathway™ — an 8-herb synergy system featuring Shilajit, Ashwagandha, Ginger, Black Musli, Gokshura, Kaunch, Ginseng, and Akarkara designed to maximize absorption. Standard mega-dose supplements lose up to 85% of their potency in digestion.</p>",
        "ggRqXQmTkxv_text": "<p>Most men notice initial improvements within 2 weeks. 94% report improved morning energy by day 14. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results.</p>",
        "ggjhL2ttWiu_text": "<p>Wellness Nest is generally well-tolerated. Some men experience mild digestive adjustment during the first few days. This typically resolves within 3-5 days.</p>",
        "ggrHHYhxxS4_text": "<p>If you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or diabetes medication, please consult your healthcare provider first.</p>",
        "ggJbZr565_u_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottle is empty.</p>",
        "ggmO4sNTttZ_text": "<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>"
      }
    },
